# Definitions {#definitions}

"Straight" {{def: straight}} means a term in straight double quotes.

“Curly” {{def: curly}} means a term in curly double quotes.

« Guillemets » {{def: guillemets}} means a term in guillemets with typographic
spacing, whose extracted term is "Guillemets" without the spaces.

„Low-high“ {{def: low-high}} means a term in low-high double quotes.

# Usage {#usage}

See {{term: straight}}, {{term: curly}}, {{term: guillemets}}, and {{term: low-high}}.
